<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia '96 public debt at 10.5 bln rgt vs 13.3.</title>
<headline>Malaysia '96 public debt at 10.5 bln rgt vs 13.3.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's federal government debt fell to 10.5 billion ringgit in 1997 against 13.3 billion ringgit in 1996, the central bank, Bank Negara said in its 1996 annual report published on Friday.</p>
<p>The overall surplus for the federal government stood at 1.8 billion ringgit in 1996, or 0.8 percent of gross national product (GNP). That represented a drop from 1.9 billion ringgit in 1995, or 0.9 percent of GNP.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
